"Deleting the shader cache only makes the next launch stutter while shaders compile again; do it if graphics break after an update. Exported saves are also kept in Files › Hinoki › Save Backups.\n\nImport takes a save from another Vita3K or a modded Vita, as a zip or a folder. From a Vita, export it decrypted first (VitaShell: \"Open decrypted\" on the save, or Vita Save Manager). The current save is backed up to Save Backups before it is replaced." = "删除着色器缓存只会让下次启动在重新编译着色器时卡顿；如果更新后画面出错，可以这样做。导出的存档也会保存在 文件 › Hinoki › Save Backups。\n\n导入支持来自其他 Vita3K 或破解 Vita 的存档，可以是 zip 或文件夹。从 Vita 导出时请先解密（VitaShell：对存档使用 “Open decrypted”，或使用 Vita Save Manager）。当前存档会在替换前备份到 Save Backups。";
