"Big screen + small screen: the big screen sits between two columns of controls, the other small beside them; tap the small one (or ⇅) to swap. Side by side, controls below: both screens across the top with every control in a band underneath, nothing covered. Side by side at the top: both screens as large as the width allows, flush with the top. The overlay layouts are Azahar's, with the controls drawn over the screens. ⇅ swaps the screens in every layout." = "大屏 + 小屏：大屏位于两列按键之间，另一块小屏在旁边；点击小屏（或 ⇅）可交换。左右并排，按键在下方：两块屏幕在上方，所有按键在下方的一条区域，不遮挡任何内容。左右并排置顶：两块屏幕在宽度允许范围内尽量大，贴着顶部。叠加布局是 Azahar 的布局，按键绘制在屏幕上方。⇅ 在所有布局中都能交换屏幕。";
