"2× looks sharp on a phone; higher costs battery and heat. Async shader compilation avoids stutter the first time effects appear; async presentation shows frames on their own thread (smoother on older devices). Custom textures load from Documents/3DS/azahar/load/textures/<title ID>." = "2× 在手机上已很清晰；更高会更耗电、更热。异步编译可避免特效首次出现时卡顿；异步呈现在独立线程上显示画面（旧设备更流畅）。自定义纹理从 Documents/3DS/azahar/load/textures/<title ID> 加载。";
