"Performance and battery" = "性能与电池";
"Battery: 1×, the coolest and longest-lasting. Balanced: 2×. Quality: 3× on newer phones. The phone has no 3D screen, so drawing one eye only is free speed. Match the screen's refresh: the 3DS draws 59.83 frames a second, the screen shows 60; running 0.3 percent faster gives every refresh a new frame instead of a small hitch every few seconds. Shader JIT: effects the GPU can't draw by itself are computed several times faster (applies at the next game start). Cool down when hot drops to 1× while iOS reports the phone as hot, then goes back. Fast forward: the » button in game, or click the right stick on a controller." = "省电：1×，最凉爽、续航最长。均衡：2×。画质：较新手机上 3×。手机没有 3D 屏幕，所以只渲染一只眼是白得的性能。匹配屏幕刷新率：3DS 每秒绘制 59.83 帧，屏幕显示 60 帧；快千分之三运行可让每次刷新都有新画面，而不是每隔几秒小卡一下。着色器 JIT：GPU 无法独立绘制的特效计算速度提升数倍（下次启动游戏时生效）。过热时降温会在 iOS 报告手机发热时降到 1×，冷却后恢复。快进：游戏中的 » 按钮，或按下手柄右摇杆。";
