"Touch the bottom screen directly. Near the button: a tap just beside a button still presses it. Floating Circle Pad: it starts where your thumb lands near it. Controllers: A, B, X and Y by position, triggers are ZL/ZR, the right stick click is fast forward, the guide button opens the menu." = "直接触摸下屏。按键附近：点在按键旁边也会按下它。浮动 Circle Pad：拇指在它附近落下的位置就是它出现的位置。手柄：A、B、X、Y 按位置对应，扳机为 ZL/ZR，按下右摇杆为快进，引导键打开菜单。";
"Remove keys" = "移除密钥";
"Games already imported keep working. Encrypted games can't be imported until you add them again." = "已导入的游戏仍可正常运行。在重新添加密钥之前，无法导入加密游戏。";
"Add keys (aes_keys.txt, seeddb.bin)" = "添加密钥（aes_keys.txt、seeddb.bin）";
"Add from Hinoki's folder" = "从 Hinoki 的文件夹添加";
"Keys" = "密钥";
"Only needed for encrypted games and CIAs (dumps you didn't decrypt). Dump the keys from your own 3DS with GodMode9 (Scripts › \"GM9Megascript\" › Dump options, or [0:]/gm9/support/aes_keys.txt), and seeddb.bin for newer games. Encrypted games are decrypted once, when you import them." = "仅加密游戏和 CIA（未解密的导出文件）需要。使用 GodMode9 从你自己的 3DS 导出密钥（Scripts › “GM9Megascript” › Dump options，或 [0:]/gm9/support/aes_keys.txt），较新的游戏还需要 seeddb.bin。加密游戏在导入时解密一次。";
"3DS settings" = "3DS 设置";
"Saves are kept by the 3DS core in Documents/3DS/azahar (Files app › Hinoki › 3DS)." = "3DS 核心将存档保存在 Documents/3DS/azahar（“文件”App › Hinoki › 3DS）。";
"Removes the game and its updates and DLC. Save data stays." = "移除游戏及其更新和 DLC。存档会保留。";
"Remove your 3DS keys?" = "移除你的 3DS 密钥？";
"Game" = "游戏";
"Add plugin (.suprx / .skprx)" = "添加插件（.suprx / .skprx）";
"A new plugin loads for every game (kernel plugins with the kernel). Tap a plugin to load it for one game only. Plugins start with the next game you open." = "新插件会为所有游戏加载（内核插件随内核加载）。点击插件可设为仅对某个游戏加载。插件会在你打开下一个游戏时启动。";
"No plugins yet." = "还没有插件。";
"Shader compiler" = "着色器编译器";
"Remove shader compiler" = "移除着色器编译器";
"Built in" = "内置";
"For ports and homebrew" = "用于移植作品和自制程序";
"Ports of Android games (built with so_loader) need kubridge, which Hinoki has built in. Ports that draw with vitaGL also need the shader compiler, libshacccg.suprx, extracted from your own PS Vita's firmware (with ShaRKF00D): add it here like a plugin." = "Android 游戏的移植版（用 so_loader 制作）需要 kubridge，Hinoki 已内置。使用 vitaGL 绘制的移植版还需要着色器编译器 libshacccg.suprx，需用 ShaRKF00D 从你自己的 PS Vita 固件中提取：像插件一样在此添加。";
"Load for" = "加载于";
"Built into Hinoki: this file is not loaded" = "已内置于 Hinoki：不会加载此文件";
"File missing: add it again" = "文件缺失：请重新添加";
"Plugins" = "插件";
"Appearance & music" = "外观与音乐";
"Storage & files" = "存储与文件";
"Emulation, graphics & audio" = "模拟、图形与音频";
"PS Vita controls" = "PS Vita 按键";
"Multiplayer" = "多人游戏";
"Memory & RAM helpers" = "内存与 RAM 助手";
"About Hinoki" = "关于 Hinoki";
"Appearance" = "外观";
"PS Vita home screen (beta)" = "PS Vita 主屏幕（测试版）";
"The Vita's home screen in landscape: bubbles on pages you swipe sideways, the start screen and LiveArea you peel away from the top-right corner, each game's own LiveArea, gate and manual, and the Vita's font and themes from your firmware." = "横屏的 Vita 主屏幕：可左右滑动的气泡页面、从右上角揭开的开始画面和 LiveArea、每个游戏自己的 LiveArea、入口和说明书，以及来自你固件的 Vita 字体和主题。";
"Start screen" = "开始画面";
"Vita theme" = "Vita 主题";
"Themes installed in Hinoki (ux0/theme) show up here, with their wallpapers." = "安装在 Hinoki 中的主题（ux0/theme）会和壁纸一起显示在这里。";
"Animated background" = "动态背景";
"Moving light and particles for each theme, with a little tilt. Off when Reduce Motion is on." = "每个主题都有流动的光影和粒子，并带一点倾斜效果。开启“减弱动态效果”时关闭。";
"Menu music" = "菜单音乐";
"Use the PS Vita home music" = "使用 PS Vita 主屏幕音乐";
"Plays the home music from your firmware (or from the selected Vita theme) instead of the songs made on your device. Needs the firmware installed; the other songs come back when it isn't found." = "播放你固件（或所选 Vita 主题）中的主屏幕音乐，而不是在设备上生成的乐曲。需要已安装固件；找不到时会恢复其他乐曲。";
"Style" = "风格";
"Mix of everything" = "混合所有风格";
"Next song" = "下一首";
"Music" = "音乐";
"Original songs composed on your device, a new one every time. Music stops when a game starts and stays quiet while another app is playing audio." = "在你的设备上创作的原创乐曲，每次都是新的。游戏开始时音乐停止，其他 App 播放音频时保持安静。";
"Location" = "位置";
"Free" = "可用";
"Used" = "已用";
"Choose folder or drive…" = "选择文件夹或磁盘…";
"Use this device's storage" = "使用本设备存储";
"Moving storage…" = "正在移动存储…";
"Built-in file picker" = "内置文件选择器";
"Storage" = "存储";
"Games, saves and firmware live here. Pick a folder on this device or on an external drive (USB-C SSD, thumb drive, microSD reader). Firmware is copied over automatically. You can also copy an existing Vita3K folder (with ux0 inside) onto the drive and pick it. Keep the drive connected while playing.\n\nBuilt-in file picker: imports pick from Hinoki's folder (Files app › On My iPhone › Hinoki) instead of the system picker. Turn it on if the system picker doesn't open or won't import, which happens with some developer-certificate signing." = "游戏、存档和固件都保存在这里。可选择本设备或外接磁盘（USB-C 固态硬盘、U 盘、microSD 读卡器）上的文件夹。固件会自动复制。你也可以把现有的 Vita3K 文件夹（内含 ux0）复制到磁盘上并选择它。游戏时请保持磁盘连接。\n\n内置文件选择器：导入时从 Hinoki 的文件夹（“文件”App › 我的 iPhone › Hinoki）选择，而不是系统选择器。如果系统选择器打不开或无法导入（某些开发者证书签名会出现这种情况），请开启。";
"Theme" = "主题";
"Sticks" = "摇杆";
"How close to a button a tap must land. Near or generous: a tap just beside a button presses the closest one." = "点击需要离按键多近才算数。附近或宽松：点在按键旁边会按下最近的按键。";
"Macro buttons" = "宏按键";
"Hide when a controller is connected" = "连接手柄时隐藏";
"Vibrate on press" = "按下时振动";
"TV mode" = "电视模式";
"With a TV connected (Screen Mirroring / AirPlay or a cable), a game you start plays on the TV only and the phone becomes the controller. Off: the TV mirrors the phone. Takes effect when a game starts; after turning it on, reconnect the TV if it is already mirroring." = "连接电视时（屏幕镜像 / AirPlay 或线缆），启动的游戏只在电视上显示，手机变成手柄。关闭：电视镜像手机画面。在游戏启动时生效；开启后，如果电视已在镜像，请重新连接电视。";
"Portrait mode" = "竖屏模式";
"Hold the phone upright to play with the game at the top and the controls below it. Landscape stays as it is; each has its own control layout." = "竖握手机游玩，游戏在上方，按键在下方。横屏保持不变；两者各有自己的按键布局。";
"Rear touchpad button" = "背面触摸板按键";
"A button at the top of the screen that sends your touches to the Vita's rear touchpad, for games that use it. Also in the game menu." = "屏幕顶部的一个按键，可将你的触摸发送到 Vita 的背面触摸板，用于需要它的游戏。游戏菜单中也有。";
"Motion controls" = "体感控制";
"Tilting the iPhone (or a controller with motion sensors) moves the Vita's gyroscope and accelerometer." = "倾斜 iPhone（或带体感的手柄）会带动 Vita 的陀螺仪和加速度计。";
"Reset control layout" = "重置按键布局";
"Button mapping" = "按键映射";
"Touch control changes apply the next time a game starts. In game, the ✕ at the top opens the game menu: screenshot, rear touchpad, edit control layout (drag and pinch to move and resize buttons) and quit. The eye button hides or shows the controls. With a controller, hold Select + Start, or press Home/PS, to open the menu." = "触控按键的更改会在下次启动游戏时生效。游戏中，顶部的 ✕ 打开游戏菜单：截图、背面触摸板、编辑按键布局（拖动和捏合来移动和缩放按键）以及退出。眼睛按钮可隐藏或显示按键。使用手柄时，按住 Select + Start 或按 Home/PS 打开菜单。";
"This phone" = "本机";
"Other player's IP, e.g. 192.168.1.23" = "对方的 IP，例如 192.168.1.23";
"Multiplayer (experimental)" = "多人游戏（实验性）";
"Local ad hoc play with other Hinoki players: both phones on the same Wi-Fi, or one joined to the other's Personal Hotspot. Type the other phone's address (shown above on that phone) on at least one of them; several addresses can be separated by commas. Then start the game's ad hoc / local mode on both, and allow Local Network access when iOS asks. Games that use Sony's ad hoc matching library don't connect yet." = "与其他 Hinoki 玩家进行本地 ad hoc 联机：两部手机连接同一 Wi-Fi，或一部连接另一部的个人热点。在至少一部手机上输入另一部手机的地址（显示在那部手机的上方）；多个地址用逗号分隔。然后在两部手机上启动游戏的 ad hoc / 本地模式，并在 iOS 询问时允许访问本地网络。使用索尼 ad hoc 匹配库的游戏暂时无法连接。";
"60 FPS mode" = "60 FPS 模式";
"Runs 30 FPS games at 60 when possible. Some games then run 2× too fast: turn it off for those (per game). A game's own 60 FPS patch is safer when there is one." = "尽可能让 30 FPS 游戏以 60 运行。有些游戏会因此快 2 倍：请为这些游戏关闭（按游戏设置）。如有游戏专用的 60 FPS 补丁则更安全。";
"Resolution & frame rate" = "分辨率与帧率";
"Higher than 1× is sharper but harder on the GPU (more heat, lower FPS). 1.5× or 2× suits most iPhones. Applies from the next game launch." = "高于 1× 更清晰，但 GPU 负担更重（更热、帧率更低）。大多数 iPhone 适合 1.5× 或 2×。从下次启动游戏时生效。";
"Compile shaders in the background" = "在后台编译着色器";
"Less stutter when new things appear. They can be missing for a moment." = "新内容出现时卡顿更少，但可能短暂缺失。";
"Fast CPU" = "快速 CPU";
"Faster maths shortcuts: less CPU work per frame, so more speed and less heat. Off by default: some games get trails, physics or animation glitches with it." = "更快的数学近似：每帧 CPU 工作更少，速度更快、发热更少。默认关闭：部分游戏开启后会出现拖影、物理或动画错误。";
"Native compressed textures" = "原生压缩纹理";
"The GPU reads the PS Vita's compressed (PVRTC) textures as they are, instead of a copy 8 to 16 times larger: less memory, less stutter when new areas load, less heat. Turn off if textures look wrong in a game. Applies from the next game launch." = "GPU 直接读取 PS Vita 的压缩（PVRTC）纹理，而不是大 8 到 16 倍的副本：更省内存，加载新区域时卡顿更少，发热更少。如果某游戏纹理显示异常请关闭。从下次启动游戏时生效。";
"Keep the phone cool" = "保持手机凉爽";
"Less heat and battery use, a bit less top speed. The game's background threads and shader compiling stay on the efficiency cores. At the first sign of warmth (or in Low Power Mode) it eases off more, before the phone gets hot: the renderer steps down and FSR, Bicubic or FXAA become Bilinear until it cools. Applies from the next game launch." = "更少发热和耗电，最高速度略低。游戏的后台线程和着色器编译留在能效核心上。一有发热迹象（或在低电量模式下）会进一步放缓，在手机变烫之前：渲染降一档，FSR、双三次或 FXAA 变为双线性，直到冷却。从下次启动游戏时生效。";
"Performance" = "性能";
"Game Mode and the fast CPU cores are used automatically." = "会自动使用游戏模式和 CPU 的高性能核心。";
"Saves compiled shaders, so the next launch stutters less." = "保存已编译的着色器，下次启动卡顿更少。";
"Texture packs" = "纹理包";
"Uses HD or translation texture packs from the textures › <title ID> folder." = "使用 textures › <title ID> 文件夹中的高清或汉化纹理包。";
"Clear all shader caches" = "清除所有着色器缓存";
"Shaders & textures" = "着色器与纹理";
"Clearing the caches can fix games whose graphics broke after an update; each game compiles its shaders again the next time." = "清除缓存可修复更新后画面出错的游戏；每个游戏下次都会重新编译着色器。";
"Clear" = "清除";
"System language" = "系统语言";
"Confirm button" = "确认键";
"✕ (Western games)" = "✕（欧美游戏）";
"○ (Japanese games)" = "○（日本游戏）";
"Performance overlay" = "性能浮层";
"Game audio" = "游戏音频";
"Player name" = "玩家名称";
"3-16 letters or digits" = "3–16 个字母或数字";
"Use a relay server" = "使用中继服务器";
"Sends a game's ad hoc (local wireless) multiplayer through a relay server, so friends anywhere can play together. Everyone needs the same server, room and game." = "通过中继服务器传输游戏的 ad hoc（本地无线）多人联机，让各地的朋友一起玩。所有人需要相同的服务器、房间和游戏。";
"Server" = "服务器";
"Room" = "房间";
"Key" = "密钥";
"none" = "无";
"Ad hoc over the internet (experimental)" = "通过互联网 ad hoc（实验性）";
"Player name is your PS Vita user name, which games show to other players. Give each device its own name (letters, digits, - and _). The server runs from tools/adhoc-relay in the Hinoki repo (Docker). Add :port if it isn't 27360. The key is only needed if the server sets one. Hinoki connects when a game starts its network." = "玩家名称是你的 PS Vita 用户名，游戏会显示给其他玩家。请为每台设备设置不同的名称（字母、数字、- 和 _）。服务器运行在 Hinoki 仓库的 tools/adhoc-relay 中（Docker）。如果端口不是 27360，请加上 :端口。只有服务器设置了密钥时才需要填写。游戏启动网络时 Hinoki 会自动连接。";
"Your container needs attention for RAM helpers" = "你的容器需要注意 RAM 助手";
"Your container supports RAM helpers" = "你的容器支持 RAM 助手";
"RAM helpers (beta)" = "RAM 助手（测试版）";
"Helper processes" = "助手进程";
"RAM checker" = "RAM 检查";
"Memory" = "内存";
"Helper processes, each with its own iOS memory limit, lend memory for the PS Vita's RAM, so big games are less likely to be closed by iOS. Takes effect at the next game launch. Some signers remove app extensions; the RAM checker shows whether the helper is there." = "助手进程各有自己的 iOS 内存上限，为 PS Vita 的 RAM 借出内存，让大型游戏更不容易被 iOS 关闭。在下次启动游戏时生效。有些签名工具会移除 App 扩展；RAM 检查会显示助手是否存在。";
"This device" = "本设备";
"Installed RAM" = "已安装内存";
"Using now" = "当前使用";
"Left before iOS closes it" = "iOS 关闭前剩余";
"Limit" = "上限";
"Setting" = "设置";
"Helper extension" = "助手扩展";
"Running in" = "运行于";
"Helpers running" = "运行中的助手";
"Lent this game" = "借给此游戏";
"Of that, in use" = "其中已使用";
"Test the RAM helper" = "测试 RAM 助手";
"RAM helpers" = "RAM 助手";
"Helpers start with a game and lend memory for its RAM; after that iOS doesn't count it against Hinoki. The numbers update every second." = "助手随游戏启动，为其 RAM 借出内存；之后 iOS 不再把这部分计入 Hinoki。数字每秒更新一次。";
"Enable JIT opens your JIT app (StikDebug, StosDebug or TrollStore; through LiveContainer when Hinoki runs inside it) and passes Hinoki's own JIT script where needed, so there's no script to set up. Vita3K notices when JIT attaches, at any time while it's open, and gets ready by itself." = "“启用 JIT”会打开你的 JIT App（StikDebug、StosDebug 或 TrollStore；若 Hinoki 运行在 LiveContainer 中则通过它），并在需要时传入 Hinoki 自己的 JIT 脚本，无需任何设置。Vita3K 在打开期间随时都能察觉 JIT 已连接，并自行准备就绪。";
"Credits" = "致谢";
"Hinoki is free software under the GNU GPL v2 or later." = "Hinoki 是遵循 GNU GPL v2 或更新版本的自由软件。";
"About" = "关于";
"Version" = "版本";
"Setup check" = "设置检查";
"Share log" = "分享日志";
"Share previous session's log" = "分享上次会话的日志";
"Report a problem…" = "报告问题…";
"Join the Discord" = "加入 Discord";
"Report a problem bundles the logs, the last crash report, your device and settings into one file to post on the Discord. Say which game and what went wrong." = "“报告问题”会把日志、最近的崩溃报告、你的设备和设置打包成一个文件，方便发到 Discord。请说明是哪个游戏、出了什么问题。";
"Pick the controller button for each PS Vita button. The on-screen controls follow this mapping automatically." = "为每个 PS Vita 按键选择手柄按键。屏幕按键会自动跟随此映射。";
"Swap ✕ and ○ (Japanese style)" = "交换 ✕ 和 ○（日式）";
"Reset to default" = "恢复默认";
"Show performance overlay" = "显示性能浮层";
"A small see-through panel over the game. It applies the next time a game starts." = "游戏上方的一个半透明小面板。在下次启动游戏时生效。";
"Show" = "显示";
"Position" = "位置";
"Text size" = "文字大小";
"Layout" = "布局";
"Thermal state is what iOS reports (it doesn't give apps a temperature). When it reaches Serious, iOS slows the chip down, and frame rates drop." = "热状态来自 iOS 的报告（它不向 App 提供温度）。达到“严重”时，iOS 会降低芯片频率，帧率下降。";
"Clear all shader caches?" = "清除所有着色器缓存？";
"General" = "通用";
"Theme, home screen, menu music" = "主题、主屏幕、菜单音乐";
"Where games and saves live, file picker" = "游戏和存档的存放位置、文件选择器";
"Resolution, filters, CPU, shaders, system language, game audio" = "分辨率、滤镜、CPU、着色器、系统语言、游戏音频";
"Touch controls, sticks, macros, controller mapping" = "触控按键、摇杆、宏、手柄映射";
"Ad hoc play between phones" = "手机之间的 ad hoc 联机";
"Game patches from the Vita3K patch list" = "来自 Vita3K 补丁列表的游戏补丁";
"taiHEN plugins: DLC loaders, ports, homebrew" = "taiHEN 插件：DLC 加载器、移植作品、自制程序";
"Keys, screens, controls, graphics, fast forward" = "密钥、屏幕、按键、图形、快进";
"More memory for heavy games, RAM checker" = "为重负载游戏提供更多内存、RAM 检查";
"StikDebug, built-in JIT, status" = "StikDebug、内置 JIT、状态";
"Version, logs, credits, Discord" = "版本、日志、致谢、Discord";
"Texture cache" = "纹理缓存";
"High accuracy" = "高精度";
"Stretch to screen" = "拉伸至全屏";
"Show shader compile progress" = "显示着色器编译进度";
"CPU optimisations" = "CPU 优化";
"PS TV mode" = "PS TV 模式";
"NGS audio" = "NGS 音频";
"How the picture is scaled to your screen. Nearest: sharp pixels. Bilinear: smooth. Bicubic: smoother. FXAA: smooths jagged edges. FSR: AMD upscaling, sharper than Bilinear at a small GPU cost." = "画面如何缩放到你的屏幕。最近邻：像素清晰。双线性：平滑。双三次：更平滑。FXAA：平滑锯齿边缘。FSR：AMD 超分辨率，比双线性更清晰，GPU 开销很小。";
"Sharper floors and walls seen at an angle. Higher costs a little GPU." = "斜看时地面和墙壁更清晰。越高 GPU 开销越大一点。";
"On: every frame waits for the screen (smoothest, no skipped frames). Off: the game never waits for the screen; a frame the screen can't take yet is skipped. Turn off for games that slow down or stutter with it on. Applies from the next game launch." = "开启：每一帧都等待屏幕（最流畅，不跳帧）。关闭：游戏从不等待屏幕；屏幕暂时无法接收的帧会被跳过。对开启后变慢或卡顿的游戏请关闭。从下次启动游戏时生效。";
"Reuses textures instead of reloading them. Faster; turn off only if textures look wrong." = "复用纹理而不是重新加载。更快；仅在纹理显示异常时关闭。";
"Draws blending and effects more exactly. Fixes some graphics, costs speed." = "更精确地绘制混合和特效。能修复部分画面问题，但会降低速度。";
"Fills the whole screen instead of keeping the Vita's shape." = "填满整个屏幕，而不是保持 Vita 的比例。";
"Shows a bar while saved shaders load at game start." = "在游戏启动加载已保存着色器时显示进度条。";
"Much faster. Turn off only to test a game that breaks." = "快得多。仅在测试出问题的游戏时关闭。";
"Tells games they run on a PS TV. Some then use the controller's extra buttons: the touch controls add L2, R2, L3 and R3 while it's on. Touch-only games may refuse to start." = "告诉游戏它运行在 PS TV 上。有些游戏会因此使用手柄的额外按键：开启时触控按键会加入 L2、R2、L3 和 R3。纯触屏游戏可能拒绝启动。";
"Tells games they run on a PS TV. Some then use the controller's extra buttons: the touch controls add L2, R2, L3 and R3 while it's on. Touch-only games may refuse to start, and some games draw their HUD wrong. Applies to every game; a game's own page can turn it off for that game." = "告诉游戏它运行在 PS TV 上。有些游戏会因此使用手柄的额外按键：开启时触控按键会加入 L2、R2、L3 和 R3。纯触屏游戏可能拒绝启动。有些游戏的 HUD 会显示错误。对所有游戏生效；可在单个游戏的页面中只为该游戏关闭。";
"The Vita's sound mixer, used by many games for music and effects. Turn off only if a game hangs on audio (it will be silent)." = "Vita 的混音器，许多游戏用它播放音乐和音效。仅在游戏卡在音频上时关闭（游戏将没有声音）。";
"Checked now. Memory and JIT change while Hinoki runs; open this again after launching a game for the latest." = "刚刚检查。Hinoki 运行时内存和 JIT 会变化；启动游戏后再次打开可查看最新情况。";
"Paste it into a bug report or the Discord when asking for help." = "求助时请粘贴到错误报告或 Discord 中。";
