"Up to four buttons that hold several Vita buttons at once. One can also steer a stick while you hold it: hold to aim and drag the same finger to look around. They appear on screen the next time a game starts; move and resize them with Edit control layout in the game menu." = "最多四个按键，可同时按住多个 Vita 按键。其中一个还能在按住时控制摇杆：按住瞄准，同一根手指拖动环视四周。它们会在下次启动游戏时出现在屏幕上；在游戏菜单中通过“编辑按键布局”移动和缩放。";
