"Example for shooters: hold L and set dragging to the right stick. Press to aim, and slide the same thumb to look around while aiming." = "射击游戏示例：按住 L，并把拖动设为右摇杆。按下瞄准，同一根拇指滑动即可边瞄准边环视。";
