"Applies to physical controllers; the on-screen buttons follow it automatically. The touch screen and rear touchpad work by touch (rear touch has its own on-screen buttons in games)." = "适用于实体手柄；屏幕按键会自动跟随。触摸屏和背面触摸板通过触摸操作（背面触摸在游戏中有自己的屏幕按键）。";
