"Patches come from github.com/Vita3K/vita3k-patches and apply the next time the game starts. An imported patch file (Vita3K's .txt format) is always on; delete it from Files › Hinoki › patch to turn it off." = "补丁来自 github.com/Vita3K/vita3k-patches，在下次启动游戏时生效。导入的补丁文件（Vita3K 的 .txt 格式）始终开启；要关闭它，请在“文件 › Hinoki › patch”中删除。";
"Use this folder" = "使用此文件夹";
"Pick plugins" = "选择插件";
