"Hinoki looks for a new release on its GitHub page and offers to install it with LiveContainer, TrollStore, SideStore or AltStore. Test builds are only offered releases made after them." = "Hinoki 会在其 GitHub 页面查找新版本，并提供用 LiveContainer、TrollStore、SideStore 或 AltStore 安装。测试版只会收到在其之后发布的版本。";
