"While the macro is held, the game feels a finger on this spot of its touchscreen: for corner taps and other touch controls, even with screen-halves sticks. Tap or drag in the box to place it." = "按住宏时，游戏会感到触摸屏的这个位置有手指按着：适用于点击角落等触控操作，在使用半屏摇杆时也可用。在框内点按或拖动来放置位置。";
