"Like a mouse: the stick moves only while your finger moves, by how fast it moves, and the camera stops the moment your finger stops, without lifting it. Aim macros follow the stick they steer. Acceleration makes slow drags finer and fast ones turn further." = "像鼠标一样：只有手指在移动时摇杆才会按其速度移动，手指一停（无需抬起）镜头立即停止。瞄准宏会跟随其控制的摇杆。加速让慢速拖动更精细、快速拖动转得更多。";
"Games ignore a small stick push. With this, the smallest drag already pushes the stick this far, so aiming answers from the first millimetre (also with aim macros). Around 20% suits most games; too much makes small moves jumpy." = "游戏会忽略摇杆的小幅推动。开启后，最小的拖动就会把摇杆推到这个程度，瞄准从第一毫米就有反应（瞄准宏也一样）。大多数游戏约 20% 合适；过大会让细微移动变得跳跃。";
"Screen-halves sticks" = "半屏摇杆";
